    "bubble_choice_description": "Use your flowchart to code the logic for content access.",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\nYour `script.js` file has the variables ready, but the `updateAppUI()` function is empty. Let's use your flowchart to have the AI write the nested logic!\r\n\r\n1. Import your flowchart from your **Backpack**.\r\n\r\n2. Prompt AI generate the code using your flowchart so the app can decide what content users can access.\r\n   \r\n2. Use the **conditionA** and **conditionB** toggles to test all four paths from your Test Cases table and verify the correct image and text appear.\r\n\r\n3. If the outcomes don't perfectly match your plan, debug it yourself or reprompt the AI to fix the mistakes."
  },
